1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,600
[Episode 16]

3
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:28,710
Hello.

4
00:01:31,070 --> 00:01:32,150
The license plate is fake.

5
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:33,640
Based on the marks at the scene,

6
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,150
my preliminary assessment is

7
00:01:34,590 --> 00:01:35,920
that the driver may have been fatigued.

8
00:01:36,510 --> 00:01:39,040
I'll ask the Traffic Accident Unit
to take another look tomorrow.

9
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,350
Okay.
Thanks for your help.

10
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,230
We're colleagues.
Don't mention it.

11
00:01:44,150 --> 00:01:44,950
Sis!

12
00:01:46,230 --> 00:01:47,040
Sis!

13
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,350
Xiaowei.

14
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:07,040
Your sister just had a fright.

15
00:02:07,230 --> 00:02:08,080
She's also had a little to drink.

16
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:10,750
Give her some yogurt when you get home,

17
00:02:10,750 --> 00:02:13,360
and some tomato juice.
She'll be fine.

18
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:14,630
Uh...

19
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,960
Sorry to trouble you.

20
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:19,360
I apologize on my sister's behalf.

21
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,310
It's fine.

22
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:25,150
Something may be troubling your sister.

23
00:02:25,470 --> 00:02:26,280
When you get home,

24
00:02:26,310 --> 00:02:27,280
try to talk her through it.

25
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:30,120
Contact me anytime if anything happens.

26
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:31,960
Okay.

27
00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:33,470
Go on.

28
00:02:35,910 --> 00:02:37,680
Come on, Sis.

29
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,470
I've got her.

30
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,630
All right.
You should head home.

31
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:05,430
Be careful on the way.

32
00:03:07,150 --> 00:03:07,960
Thank you.

33
00:03:08,910 --> 00:03:09,710
Let's go.

34
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,080
Hey.

35
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:42,680
You nearly got into a car accident

36
00:03:42,870 --> 00:03:44,520
just to buy a girl some water.

37
00:03:44,630 --> 00:03:46,630
I was just careless.

38
00:03:47,470 --> 00:03:50,910
That girl must mean a lot to you.

39
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:55,310
You've been like this since childhood,

40
00:03:55,470 --> 00:03:58,360
always getting bumps and cuts.

41
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,560
Whenever I asked what happened,

42
00:04:00,750 --> 00:04:03,960
you'd call scars a badge of manhood.

43
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,120
You're not real.

44
00:04:12,750 --> 00:04:13,840
Ignoring me again?

45
00:04:15,870 --> 00:04:19,360
You last ignored me
when you were in seventh grade.

46
00:04:20,070 --> 00:04:23,240
One morning, you suddenly said
you wanted to quit school

47
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:25,240
and go earn money.

48
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,120
So I beat you.

49
00:04:29,510 --> 00:04:30,310
You cried.

50
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:32,120
So did I.

51
00:04:33,270 --> 00:04:34,360
Mom and Dad died when we were young.

52
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:36,160
We'd suffered so much.

53
00:04:37,750 --> 00:04:39,480
If you even dropped out of school,

54
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:41,510
we'd suffer forever.

55
00:04:43,430 --> 00:04:44,310
I don't care.

56
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,950
I just want you back.

57
00:04:52,870 --> 00:04:54,510
I never imagined

58
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,310
the first time I hit you

59
00:04:59,950 --> 00:05:01,720
would also be the last time I saw you.

60
00:05:07,750 --> 00:05:09,160
Where are you?

61
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:12,160
Where are you?

62
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:45,240
[Missing Girl Files]

63
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:52,560
[Missing Girl Files]

64
00:05:55,630 --> 00:05:56,680
Sorry, boss.

65
00:05:59,830 --> 00:06:02,720
Useless!
Is killing someone that hard?

66
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,120
He reacted too quickly.
I had no chance.

67
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,480
I promise it won't happen again.

68
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:08,630
Again?
You think there'll be another chance?

69
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,190
Do you take the police for fools?

70
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,720
Get ready.

71
00:06:17,630 --> 00:06:19,270
Take everything you can.

72
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,310
Yes.

73
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:36,430
Uncle He,
I have evidence of Sun Jiahao's crimes.

74
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:38,240
I'm on my way to his company now.

75
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,510
Send a team to back me up right away.

76
00:06:39,510 --> 00:06:40,680
Don't do anything rash.

77
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:41,720
Wait for our backup.

78
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,800
Okay.
All right.

79
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,600
See you in a bit.

80
00:07:12,510 --> 00:07:13,120
Hurry!

81
00:07:13,830 --> 00:07:14,430
Come out!

82
00:07:16,950 --> 00:07:17,390
Hurry!

83
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,240
Get in the car!

84
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:23,430
Hurry!

85
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,390
Quick!
After her!

86
00:07:36,630 --> 00:07:39,000
Run!
Keep running!

87
00:07:39,870 --> 00:07:40,390
Stop!

88
00:07:42,070 --> 00:07:43,390
Stop!
Police!

89
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,480
Police!

90
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:47,630
Put it down!

91
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,240
Captain Ren.

92
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:40,000
I'm in the basement parking garage
at Luoda Biotech.

93
00:08:40,670 --> 00:08:41,030
Get over here!

94
00:08:41,390 --> 00:08:42,320
Are you okay?

95
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,480
Backup will be there any second.

96
00:08:43,910 --> 00:08:44,670
Stay safe.

97
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:45,630
Whatever you do, don't...

98
00:09:13,910 --> 00:09:15,320
Help me!

99
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,030
Sis...

100
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,240
Help me!

101
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,720
Officer Han.

102
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,270
We meet again.

103
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,600
Sun Jiahao.

104
00:10:04,390 --> 00:10:06,120
You're under arrest.

105
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:09,480
I didn't expect you to be so brave,
Officer.

106
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,200
You walked right into my hands.

107
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:14,480
Don't kill him.

108
00:10:50,270 --> 00:10:51,390
Nobody move!

109
00:10:52,550 --> 00:10:53,150
Police!

110
00:10:55,670 --> 00:10:56,910
Get down!
Hands on your head!

111
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:05,750
Han Ning!

112
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,120
Han Ning!

113
00:11:08,790 --> 00:11:09,600
Han Ning!

114
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,000
Call an ambulance!

115
00:11:50,750 --> 00:11:52,810
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

116
00:11:52,810 --> 00:11:54,760
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

117
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:56,670
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

118
00:11:56,670 --> 00:11:58,480
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

119
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,810
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

120
00:12:00,810 --> 00:12:03,240
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

121
00:12:06,380 --> 00:12:08,290
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

122
00:12:08,290 --> 00:12:10,190
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

123
00:12:10,190 --> 00:12:12,130
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

124
00:12:12,130 --> 00:12:14,260
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

125
00:12:14,290 --> 00:12:16,270
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

126
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:18,430
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

127
00:12:22,020 --> 00:12:25,500
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

128
00:12:25,500 --> 00:12:28,870
♪Why is that child crying?♪

129
00:12:29,100 --> 00:12:31,570
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

130
00:12:31,570 --> 00:12:33,190
♪Means I've grown up♪

131
00:12:33,190 --> 00:12:36,340
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

132
00:12:36,340 --> 00:12:39,820
♪The wound still aches♪

133
00:12:40,230 --> 00:12:44,580
♪Like a biting winter♪

134
00:12:44,580 --> 00:12:47,850
♪But a spark still glows♪

